  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2206.03 Prescription Drug Monitoring Program Investigations. All pharmacy board investigations concerning the prescription drug monitoring program shall be referred to the respective board of the licensee upon completion.\n\nSource. #12997, eff 3-5-20",
